        "hardwareFingerprint",
        "pythonVersion",
        "pytestVersion"
      ],
      "note": "workerClientFingerprint is not bound per-receipt; it is bound current at seal level by the increment3 strictGate input fingerprint, so client drift routes through that leaf."
